# Everything the build produces or the image has no use for. Keeping this tight
# matters twice: the build context is uploaded to the builder on every deploy,
# and a stale local bin/ or wwwroot/ copied in would silently override what the
# image just compiled.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Vite writes here; the image builds its own copy in the web stage.
src/WeGo.Api/wwwroot/

# Local databases and the dev signing key — a key committed into an image is a
# key shared by every deployment of it.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.wego-signing-key
.travelism-signing-key

artifacts/
TestResults/
**/*.trx
**/coverage*.xml

.git/
.github/
**/.gitignore

# Docs and specs: they change constantly and would bust the build cache for
# nothing.
*.md
!README.md

.env
.env.*
